        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eaton_Estates%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "It borders the village of Grafton to the south and the unincorporated area of North Eaton to the east.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eaton_Estates%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "State Routes 82 and 83 form Eaton Estates’ northern and western limits, linking it to Strongsville, Brentwood Lake, North Ridgeville, and Litchfield.",
