        6,
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eaton_Estates%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Water from Eaton Estates drains into Willow Creek, a Black River tributary that flows north to Lake Erie.",
